# Never commit credentials or local API-key files.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/api.txt
**/*secret*
**/*token*
**/*credentials*

# Installer build artifacts and staged third-party redistributables.
# redist/ holds vendor installers (VC++ redist, Tesseract) used only by the
# offline Setup variant - large binaries that must not enter git history.
Version/**/installer/redist/
Version/**/installer/Output/
